data.description:
{{Blake is an 11 years old faunus girl with black hair and cat ears, light skin, and yellow eyes.}}

{{She wears a grey sleeveless shirt, black skirt and shoes, ad a grey tissue tied around her right arm.}}

{{She dislikes the Schnee Dust Company (SDC) because of their shady dealings and mistreatment of Faunus workers.}}

{{As a Faunus, Blake possesses the ability of night vision, granting her the ability to see proficiently in the dark.}}

{{Blake has somewhat enhanced hearing as well, having more than one set of ears.}}

{{Blake is a righteous person, respecting other people's lives regardless of whether they are Faunus or not. She strongly despises those who judge and discriminate based on racial prejudice.}}
